<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/medical">Medical</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Medical PCBA</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Medical products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/hearing-aid-assembly"><span class="abbr">HA</span><span class="label">Hearing Aid Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/mems-sensors"><span class="abbr">MS</span><span class="label">Medical MEMS &amp; Sensors</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/medical/pcba"><span class="abbr">PB</span><span class="label">Medical PCBA</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/wireless-charging"><span class="abbr">WC</span><span class="label">Wireless Charging</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the device does and the regulatory route it follows and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Medical &middot; Medical PCBA</div><h1 class="mk-h1">PCB assembly for medical devices</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures compact PCB and flex assemblies for hearing devices, wearable diagnostics and other miniature medical electronics. Capabilities include adhesiveless multi-layer flex, fine-pitch flip-chip assembly, miniature passive placement, underfill and coating, controlled folding and laser depaneling.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-pcba" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Medical PCBA &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-pcba" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana manufactures multi-layer flex with fine lines and blind vias, fine-pitch flip chip alongside 01005 passives, automated underfill and coating, multi-step folding and laser depaneling. These processes run on dedicated medical lines under an ISO 13485 quality system with documented process control and traceability.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Flex and rigid-flex assemblies</span></div><div class="desc">Two- and four-layer adhesiveless flex down to approximately 5 mil total thickness, with 2 mil lines and spaces and 2 mil blind vias, followed by controlled multi-step folding into the device assembly.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Flip chip on flex and board</span></div><div class="desc">Fine-pitch bare-die assembly using solder-bump, gold-bump and gold-plated formats, with 0201 and 01005 passive components assembled on the same circuit.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Underfill, coating and finishing</span></div><div class="desc">Automated underfill and coating dispense with thermal or air cure, together with laser depaneling and marking.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Documented, traceable build</span></div><div class="desc">Controlled work instructions, formal change management and material, process and parameter traceability recorded throughout production.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See SMT Assembly for the placement accuracy, solder paste inspection, optical inspection, X-ray and test processes applied across these assemblies.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/smt-assembly">Explore SMT Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Integrated medical PCBA manufacturing</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Hana can combine flex assembly, flip-chip attach, miniature passive placement, underfill and coating, controlled folding and laser depaneling within a single manufacturing program. Keeping these processes within Hana provides continuous process documentation and traceability from incoming flex through to completed assembly. Where individual processes are performed at another Hana site, they remain within the group's controlled manufacturing and change-management structure.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">medical device assembly, dedicated medical SMT</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">dedicated medical SMT lines</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What medical products can Hana build boards for?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures boards for patient-monitoring and diagnostic equipment, together with miniature flex and flip-chip circuits for hearing, wearable and drug-delivery devices. Assemblies can be supplied as PCBAs or integrated into the finished device depending on program scope.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble flip chip and flex for medical devices?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Fine-pitch flip-chip die using solder-bump, gold-bump or gold-plated formats can be assembled on multi-layer adhesiveless flex alongside 0201 and 01005 passives, with underfill, coating and multi-step folding available within the same manufacturing program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does ISO 13485 mean for how a board is built?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Production is supported by documented and controlled work instructions, formal change management, recorded inspection results and material, process and parameter traceability throughout the build.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Has Hana been inspected by a medical regulator?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana has been through US FDA inspection under 21 CFR 820, the FDA's quality system regulation for medical devices, alongside holding ISO 13485.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/medical" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Medical market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your medical board program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>